{"id":"0cbb4dd8eee9e878","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-complex-bss-p-np.md","title":"Polynomial-Time and NP Classes over the Complex Field","display":"df-complex-bss-p-np — Polynomial-Time and NP Classes over the Complex Field","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-complex-bss-p-np","aliases":["28-df-complex-bss-p-np"],"display":"df-complex-bss-p-np — Polynomial-Time and NP Classes over the Complex Field","depends_on":["[[28-df-bss-machine]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 16.23","source_printed_pages":"332","source_pdf_pages":"358","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-complex-bss-p-np"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-complex-bss-p-np</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complex-bss-p-np — Polynomial-Time and NP Classes over the Complex Field"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9d0a020880cb80e9\" href=\"?note=9d0a020880cb80e9\" title=\"28-df-bss-machine\">28-df-bss-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 16.23"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"332"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"358"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^{&lt;\\omega}_{+}=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathbb C^n\">\\(\\mathbb C^{&lt;\\omega}_{+}=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathbb C^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb C},\\operatorname{time}_M,\\operatorname{out}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb C},\\operatorname{time}_M,\\operatorname{out}_M\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9d0a020880cb80e9\" href=\"?note=9d0a020880cb80e9\" title=\"28-df-bss-machine\">28-df-bss-machine</a> 的等值分支复数域模型，所有输入要求正常停机。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle=(n,x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y_1,\\ldots,y_m)\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle=(n,x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y_1,\\ldots,y_m)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb C^n,y\\in\\mathbb C^m\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb C^n,y\\in\\mathbb C^m\\)</span>）为带长度的元组配对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P_{\\mathbb C}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^{&lt;\\omega}_{+}:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb C}\\ \\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb C^n\\ [\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le c(n+1)^d\\land\\operatorname{out}_M(x)=\\mathbf1[x\\in L]]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm P_{\\mathbb C}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^{&lt;\\omega}_{+}:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb C}\\ \\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb C^n\\ [\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le c(n+1)^d\\land\\operatorname{out}_M(x)=\\mathbf1[x\\in L]]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NP}_{\\mathbb C}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^{&lt;\\omega}_{+}:\\exists L_0\\in\\mathrm P_{\\mathbb C}\\ \\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ \\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb C^n\\ [x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb C^{p(n)}\\ \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in L_0]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NP}_{\\mathbb C}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^{&lt;\\omega}_{+}:\\exists L_0\\in\\mathrm P_{\\mathbb C}\\ \\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ \\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb C^n\\ [x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb C^{p(n)}\\ \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in L_0]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0\\text{-}1\\text{-}\\mathrm{NP}_{\\mathbb C}\\coloneqq\\{L\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{+}:L\\in\\mathrm{NP}_{\\mathbb C}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0\\text{-}1\\text{-}\\mathrm{NP}_{\\mathbb C}\\coloneqq\\{L\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{+}:L\\in\\mathrm{NP}_{\\mathbb C}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证书为复数元组，不能偷换成二进制串；输入大小是域元素数而非其位长。源书用n^d证书长度，本条用一般多项式并可通过填充等价转换。输出在所有输入停机的要求排除除零卡住。模型实现补全继承上游说明，未将复数域类冒称通常实数有序BSS类。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 16.23；印刷页 332；PDF 页 358。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第16章的 Polynomial-Time and NP Classes over the Complex Field，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>R5上游复核：等值分支可检测原始空白符号，因此输入长度/配对边界可扫描确定；算术空白转零约定不影响此检测。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-bss-machine","status":"resolved","id":"9d0a020880cb80e9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bss-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bss-machine","status":"resolved","id":"9d0a020880cb80e9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb C^{<\\omega}_{+}=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathbb C^n$；$\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb C},\\operatorname{time}_M,\\operatorname{out}_M$ 使用 [[28-df-bss-machine]] 的等值分支复数域模型，所有输入要求正常停机。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb C^{<\\omega}_{+}=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathbb C^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb C},\\operatorname{time}_M,\\operatorname{out}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle=(n,x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y_1,\\ldots,y_m)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb C^n,y\\in\\mathbb C^m","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb N[t]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm P_{\\mathbb C}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^{<\\omega}_{+}:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{BSS}_{\\mathbb C}\\ \\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb C^n\\ [\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le c(n+1)^d\\land\\operatorname{out}_M(x)=\\mathbf1[x\\in L]]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NP}_{\\mathbb C}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^{<\\omega}_{+}:\\exists L_0\\in\\mathrm P_{\\mathbb C}\\ \\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ \\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb C^n\\ [x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb C^{p(n)}\\ \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in L_0]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"0\\text{-}1\\text{-}\\mathrm{NP}_{\\mathbb C}\\coloneqq\\{L\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{+}:L\\in\\mathrm{NP}_{\\mathbb C}\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2572,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-361","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program]]、[[28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound]]、[[28-df-arithmetic-formula]]、[[28-df-polynomial-projection]]、[[28-df-algebraic-computation-tree]]、[[28-thm-element-distinctness-components]]、[[28-df-bss-machine]]、[[28-df-complex-bss-p-np]]。"}],"outgoing":["9d0a020880cb80e9"]}